@local/super-jipaige-board README · Super 鸡排哥看板 · Super Jipaige Board：> A factory assembly-line dashboard for [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) that visualizes how `dsh-superagent`（鸡排哥）dispatches work to worker agents in real time.

一个 **DSH（DeepSeek Harness）本地插件**。它在会话工作区新增一个「🍗 鸡排哥看板」标签页，用**工厂流水线**的方式实时观测 `dsh-superagent`（鸡排哥）的派单调度。

纯 JavaScript，**无构建步骤、无 npm 依赖**。

@local/super-jipaige-board README · 2. 注册成 profile bundle：**方式 A（推荐）**——在 DSH 的 Web 会话里让 agent 执行：

```
plugin_manager
  action: install_bundle
  target: /绝对路径/.local/share/deepseek-superagent/plugins/super-jipaige-board
```

**方式 B（手动）**——编辑目标 profile 的 `package.json`：

```json
{
  "dependencies": {
    "@local/super-jipaige-board": "link:/绝对路径/.local/share/deepseek-superagent/plugins/super-jipaige-board"
  },

@local/super-jipaige-board README · 3. 生效：```
plugin_manager { action: "set_bundle", target: "@local/super-jipaige-board", enabled: false }
plugin_manager { action: "set_bundle", target: "@local/super-jipaige-board", enabled: true }
```

然后刷新浏览器页面即可。打开任意会话，工作区视图行会出现「🍗 鸡排哥看板」标签页。

完整说明见 [INSTALL.md](INSTALL.md)。
